{
  "sn7.13:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 7.13 ",
  "sn7.13:0.2": "2. Upāsakavagga ",
  "sn7.13:0.3": "Devahitasutta ",
  "sn7.13:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn7.13:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena bhagavā vātehābādhiko hoti; ",
  "sn7.13:1.3": "āyasmā ca upavāṇo bhagavato upaṭṭhāko hoti. ",
  "sn7.13:1.4": "Atha kho bhagavā āyasmantaṁ upavāṇaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn7.13:1.5": "“iṅgha me tvaṁ, upavāṇa, uṇhodakaṁ jānāhī”ti. ",
  "sn7.13:1.6": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho āyasmā upavāṇo bhagavato paṭissutvā nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya yena devahitassa brāhmaṇassa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā tuṇhībhūto ekamantaṁ aṭṭhāsi. ",
  "sn7.13:1.7": "Addasā kho devahito brāhmaṇo āyasmantaṁ upavāṇaṁ tuṇhībhūtaṁ ekamantaṁ ṭhitaṁ. ",
  "sn7.13:1.8": "Disvāna āyasmantaṁ upavāṇaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi: ",
  "sn7.13:2.1": "“Tuṇhībhūto bhavaṁ tiṭṭhaṁ, ",
  "sn7.13:2.2": "muṇḍo saṅghāṭipāruto; ",
  "sn7.13:2.3": "Kiṁ patthayāno kiṁ esaṁ, ",
  "sn7.13:2.4": "kiṁ nu yācitumāgato”ti. ",
  "sn7.13:3.1": "“Arahaṁ sugato loke, ",
  "sn7.13:3.2": "vātehābādhiko muni; ",
  "sn7.13:3.3": "Sace uṇhodakaṁ atthi, ",
  "sn7.13:3.4": "munino dehi brāhmaṇa. ",
  "sn7.13:4.1": "Pūjito pūjaneyyānaṁ, ",
  "sn7.13:4.2": "sakkareyyāna sakkato; ",
  "sn7.13:4.3": "Apacito apaceyyānaṁ, ",
  "sn7.13:4.4": "tassa icchāmi hātave”ti. ",
  "sn7.13:5.1": "Atha kho devahito brāhmaṇ